<title>UK: Medeva wins Hepagene patent challenge.</title>
<headline>Medeva wins Hepagene patent challenge.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>British drugs company Medeva Plc said the House of Lords had dismissed Biogen's UK patent challenge to Hepagene, its hepatitis B treatment, representing a final verdict in the case.</p>
<p>It said the House of Lords ruling upheld the Court of Appeal decision that Biogen's patent number 0182442 &quot;is invalid in the UK.&quot;</p>
</text>
